<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 102,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 102,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 102,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 lower than the mid-session Tuesday. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    48.50 -49.00	   49.50 -50.00</p>
<p>few			48.00 &amp;49.50	   49.00 &amp;50.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.50. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -43.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -50.00	   48.00 -50.00</p>
